# HD Satelit: regulile garzii de model pentru Dreambox DM800SE (masina dm800se, MACHINEBUILD dm800se), NECONFIRMAT
# (V21B, 14.11.2026). Stratul producatorului: meta-dream din OE-Alliance 6.0 (conf/machine/dm800se.conf): cip bcm7405,
# MIPS 400 MHz, 256 MB RAM, NAND 64 MB (brcmnand, sector 512), nucleu linux-dreambox 3.2 FARA UBIFS, driverele Dream
# dreambox-dvb-modules-dm800se 3.2-20151201. DM800SE v2 (masina dm800sev2, alt incarcator) si clonele NU sunt acoperite.
# NUMAI varianta pe stick (HDS_VARIANTA=usb): in memoria interna (root 60 MiB) sta pornirea mica a noastra
# (hdsatelit-pornire-stick-image, jffs2, .nfi din modul de salvare), care porneste sistemul din hdsatelit-dm800se/radacina.ext4.
# chip=-, boxtype=dm800se din /proc/stb/info/model (al treilea nod, ca la DM7020HD si DM8000).
# Partitiile (peticul Dream al nucleului 3.2, citite de V21): complete 64 MiB, loader 256 KiB, boot 3,75 MiB, root 60 MiB.
format=1
distro=hdsatelit
model=Dreambox DM800SE
machine=dm800se
machinebuild=dm800se
chip=-
boxtype=dm800se
hw=-
partitions=complete,loader:256K,boot:3840K,root
kernel_part=mtd2
kernel_kib=3840
rootfs_part=mtd3
kernel_name=boot
rootfs_name=root
stocare=nand
confirmat=nu
familie=broadcom
